{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0204_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1f55411edbf7c39f499b70f3a58462a6ee2a9849dc1f1b51cfcc2cd78525ea83", "ja": "（今日の仕事は『聖ミリオン女学園』。\n撮影は順調に進み、次は美希たちの番だ……）", "zh": "（今天的工作是《圣百万女学园》。\n拍摄进展顺利，接下来就轮到美希她们了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0204_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "61d8cb3b628601c154cac9badddc25ed2ed0a7441345c19863f281fc864fa5c9", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}だ。\nおつかれさまなの～！", "zh": "啊，是{$P$}。\n辛苦啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0204_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "ad166153b237ae6f2e8c883c1bb3ad1f835d4e6c5d1fcfbf29a2eff552cc004b", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん♪\n撮影、これから始まるところですよ！", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生♪\n拍摄现在正要开始哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0204_1003_048rei", "source_sha256": "1197c75b15ac1c3e754359070aff1fdfba54335e74e969f2d5e12e6b1346f711", "ja": "見てください、美希ちゃんのドレス♪\nとってもステキですよね♪", "zh": "您看，美希的礼服♪\n真的很漂亮吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0204_1004_003mik", "source_sha256": "c5057a64ce99fa727d5ae2958038eb8d94e5d2355eba4c281c500d5fdb30348c", "ja": "{$P$}、どう？\nドレス、今日のミキにも似合ってるかな？", "zh": "{$P$}，怎么样？\n这身礼服也很适合今天的美希吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0204_1005_p", "source_sha256": "e4dfb3fec039024df21335062f0efe169947329671e927150ba902704cab918a", "ja": "うん、今日の美希にもバッチリ似合ってるぞ！\n本番の撮影が楽しみだな。", "zh": "嗯，今天的美希穿这件也特别合适！\n真期待正式拍摄啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0204_1006_003mik", "source_sha256": "2945d55b850fca46887ba4a72a7684413a57882cf67b1b7d2afe4e1ccf115a26", "ja": "それならよかったの！　けど{$P$}、\nどうしてミキだけドレスなの？　麗花と星梨花は？", "zh": "那就好！不过，{$P$}，为什么只有美希穿礼服？丽花和星梨花呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0204_1007_p", "source_sha256": "84e59c51fbfe77048f7d9c732229b162211dfe1483ea05585ee65510ce112738", "ja": "ああ。この後は、みんなドレスを着て\n卒業パーティーのダンスを踊るシーンなんだけど……。", "zh": "啊。接下来是大家穿上礼服，跳毕业派对舞蹈的场景，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0204_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "ddfe98aaa73735ec594e01692da9bab5c92c2247ba338cb22ced0b2a199ed5e8", "ja": "卒業パーティーでダンスなんて、ステキですね！\nまるで、プロムみたいです！", "zh": "在毕业派对上跳舞，真棒啊！\n简直就像舞会一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0204_1009_p", "source_sha256": "90ff5578fecf197efe0bd11430a0eee2629ca0fa2148091157fb9ecda9149f4b", "ja": "そういう位置付けだな。……けどその前に、\n美希と麗花、ふたりきりのシーンを撮影するそうだ。", "zh": "就是这么安排的。……不过在那之前，\n听说要拍摄美希和丽花两个人单独相处的场景。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0204_1010_048rei", "source_sha256": "5f638f3add8d9e5e5d2191502bd44856675f72c298fb7a9d20de758a44ce0832", "ja": "私と美希ちゃんが、ふたりきりのシーン……\nあっ、わかりました！　あれですね♪", "zh": "我和美希是两个人单独拍摄的场景……\n啊，我明白了！是那个吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0204_1011_003mik", "source_sha256": "9830328c9b0b6e8827c87d0ee526aeb8268e41a95ac437040aef741dc41747a2", "ja": "あれ？", "zh": "那个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0204_1012_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0204_1013_003mik", "source_sha256": "fe3fe03fa6bae852442d9d0985fba4fe3603ef5568f54ed73f1eb28791f57184", "ja": "麗花お姉さま……。", "zh": "丽花姐姐……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0204_1014_048rei", "source_sha256": "508bbaff4baadb1e4fd17f60200835968ab2b1f5b1e79dc235c8e96520fe5f20", "ja": "美希ちゃん。私が選んだドレス、着てくれたのね。\n……すごく綺麗。似合ってるわ。", "zh": "美希。你穿上我选的礼服了呀。\n……真的好漂亮。很适合你呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0204_1015_048rei", "source_sha256": "3e7413d79c0490cb50bef8f3f6fb6bd430a2ef3f324908ad8abd1b039e7ba60c", "ja": "ふふっ。なんだか、卒業したくなくなっちゃった。", "zh": "呵呵，感觉都不想毕业了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0204_1016_003mik", "source_sha256": "cf2667491ea5d8cae5e0184452a1418af30f9c16a0ba940c03ef00fb441a0dd1", "ja": "……しなくていいよ。", "zh": "……不毕业也可以哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0204_1017_048rei", "source_sha256": "db71fc97bfca9ec3f859ad8bdfa949eb9d46c4f3b08b6d375a913c8067ccb353", "ja": "美希ちゃん？", "zh": "美希？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0204_1018_003mik", "source_sha256": "8e8ea2bc4befb46f19d73afd58bbe0146953dfa18d3fd436796c0dec1b2aef60", "ja": "ずっと一緒にいようよ！\n私と、星梨花と……ずっと、一緒に……。", "zh": "永远在一起吧！\n和我、星梨花……永远、在一起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0204_1019_048rei", "source_sha256": "6ca7b42820f0df72c328b8202870d4380c3b7f4f083170d2bfc8c7c5edb7ff6d", "ja": "美希ちゃん……ありがとう。\nそんなに思われて、私、幸せだな……♪", "zh": "美希，谢谢你。\n能被你这样放在心上，我真的好幸福……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0204_1020_048rei", "source_sha256": "f7440d72e340889edcc969323a1dc92b42f83fb1bf9d3f72c87c858c8aaded44", "ja": "さぁ、私も着替えてこなくちゃ！\n素敵な妹に負けないように……ね。ふふっ！", "zh": "好啦，我也得去换衣服了！\n可不能输给这么棒的妹妹……对吧。呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0204_1022_022ser", "source_sha256": "dac5972b137a22b137c74c07a7cc6e0c7b3d53ddbe8e7d6bd7edfc69c683843c", "ja": "美希さん！　今のシーン、すっごくステキでした！\nわたし、思わずもらい泣きしちゃって……グスッ。", "zh": "美希姐姐！刚才那一幕，真的特别精彩！我不由得跟着哭了起来……抽泣。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0204_1023_p", "source_sha256": "c7f7b221c4c6cf9b724d6f68fac8f466a98d9c6d360a3818f50ab2ac508da046", "ja": "ああ、すごく良かったよ。大好きなお姉さまが\n卒業してしまう事への、切なさが出てたな……グスッ。", "zh": "啊，真的很棒。对最喜欢的姐姐即将毕业的\n那份不舍之情，表现得非常到位……呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0204_1024_003mik", "source_sha256": "9de0b8b60556857ccc6b8a9a9d0d50ecb3697127c89a01a2259ff05f02435e8c", "ja": "星梨花はともかく、{$P$}まで\n泣いてるの？　ふたりとも、寂しがりやさんなの。", "zh": "星梨花先不说，连{$P$}都哭了？你们两个都是很怕寂寞的人呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0204_1025_048rei", "source_sha256": "efba2bfc70192b0685af82f7740aa4db5085ac105aa7fac33edb5336c34d1837", "ja": "これは、私たちで慰めてあげないとだね♪\n撮影が終わったら、さっそくお昼寝タイムですよ！", "zh": "这下得由我们来安慰她们才行呢♪\n拍摄结束后，就马上进入午睡时间吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0204_1026_003mik", "source_sha256": "ff91259c41abaeb95f93f43b8dbfb1be8cc2f0985f9a3fae8c004cfa4dee3eae", "ja": "うん、いいよ。麗花お姉さまは卒業したから、\nふたりの面倒を見るのは、ミキのお仕事なの。", "zh": "嗯，可以呀。丽花姐姐已经毕业了，\n所以照顾你们两个，就是美希的工作啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0204_1027_003mik", "source_sha256": "f3b5702423004033593cb1d49ad9499c3e974038114a35eec5a4641e1b12476e", "ja": "ミキがやさし～く寝かしつけてあげるから、\nいい子でお昼寝するんだよ？　あはっ☆", "zh": "我会温柔地哄你们睡觉，所以要乖乖睡午觉哦？啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
